Challenge 97: Identify the Domain Name

Question: What is the domain name for the machine located at 172.25.170.80, including the suffix?

Answer: ECC.LOCALNET

Commands used
nmap -Pn -sV -sC -p- --min-rate 1000 172.25.170.80
ldapsearch -x -H ldap://172.25.170.80 -b "" -s base "(objectClass=*)" defaultNamingContext rootDomainNamingContext dnsHostName
Important output
defaultNamingContext: DC=ECC,DC=LOCALNET
rootDomainNamingContext: DC=ECC,DC=LOCALNET
dnsHostName: 2012-DC.ECC.LOCALNET

Conclusion: The domain name is ECC.LOCALNET. The machine's hostname is 2012-DC.ECC.LOCALNET.
